### =========================================================================

### AlpineBytes Universal .gitignore Template

### Core files to exclude from your open-source projects

### =========================================================================

### --- System and OS Files ---

desktop.ini
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Log.txt
*.log 

### --- Node.js / JavaScript Dependencies ---

node_modules/
/dist/
/build/
.npm/ 

### --- Python Virtual Environments & Cache ---

venv/
.venv/
env/
.env_space/
**pycache**/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.Python
htmlcov/
.tox/
.coverage
.cache/ 

### --- IDEs and Text Editors ---

.vscode/
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.swp 

### --- Security and Environment Secrets ---

### NEVER commit your API keys, tokens, or passwords!

.env
.env.local
.env.development.local
.env.test.local
.env.production.local
*.pem
*.key
certs/ 

### --- Executables and Binaries ---

### Prevents compiled code and application builds from entering the repo

main.exe
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
